@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor

Editor -> System : asks to create a scenario
activate System

    System --> Editor : request map selection
    Editor -> System : select map

    System --> Editor : request locomotive restrictions
    Editor -> System : set allowed types

    System --> Editor : show summary and confirm
    Editor -> System : confirm data

    System --> Editor :displays operation success
deactivate System
deactivate Editor
@enduml